#. Error after trying to pass on an Operator Pass when all your other passes are already offered to someone. A confirmation for passing on your last pass opens next.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/OperatorPassPassItOnModal.tsx
msgid "Your other passes are all on offer. This is your last one."
msgstr "Vse tvoje druge prepustnice so že ponujene. To je tvoja zadnja."

#. Text under the heading Your Operator certificate on a slide in the Operator Pass checkout dialog. The certificate is a PDF with one page for each pass, and each page has its own number, the name chosen at checkout and the date and time of payment. Always call it a certificate, never a diploma, card, collectible, token or license, and never suggest it can be resold or has cash value. Keep Operator in English. Checkout is where you pay. Settings are the app settings, where each certificate page has its own private link. The last two sentences tell a buyer who buys a pass as a gift to type the other person's name on that page. Calm and plain.
#: src/features/premium/components/operator_pass/checkout/OperatorPassShowcaseSlides.ts
msgid "Your pass comes with this certificate. It's a PDF with one page for each pass, and each page has its own number, the name you choose at checkout and the date and time you paid. We email it to you, and in settings each page has its own link that you can open, print or share. Buying for someone else? Put their name on their certificate."
msgstr "S prepustnico dobiš ta certifikat. To je PDF z eno stranjo za vsako prepustnico, vsaka stran pa ima svojo številko, ime, ki ga izbereš ob zaključku nakupa, ter datum in čas plačila. Pošljemo ti ga po e-pošti, v nastavitvah pa ima vsaka stran svojo povezavo, ki jo lahko odpreš, natisneš ali deliš. Kupuješ za nekoga drugega? Na njegov certifikat napiši njegovo ime."

#. Description of the Fluxer Labs section in the Operator Pass settings. The pass is the Operator Pass. #operators is a channel name, keep it as is. {labsName} is the name of the community, such as Fluxer Labs.
#: src/features/user/components/modals/tabs/operator_pass_tab/OperatorPassLabsGreetingSetting.tsx
msgid "Your pass opens #operators in {labsName}, where you can talk about self-hosting, bots and the API."
msgstr "Prepustnica ti odpre #operators v {labsName}, kjer se lahko pogovarjaš o lastnem gostovanju, botih in API-ju."

#. Name of the section in the Operator Pass settings tab that lists the Operator Passes the account holds.
#: src/features/premium/utils/PremiumMessageDescriptors.ts
msgid "Your passes"
msgstr "Tvoje prepustnice"

#. Settings search entry description for the Operator Pass settings tab. One-line summary of what the tab holds. Operators' wall is the name of a section of the homepage.
#: src/features/user/components/settings_utils/search_index/OperatorPassIndex.ts
msgid "Your passes, your certificate and your spot on the Operators' wall"
msgstr "Tvoje prepustnice, certifikat in mesto na zidu Operatorjev"

#. Error shown when a passkey or security key prompt fails for a reason Fluxer has no specific message for. {detail} is a technical error code such as UnknownError or com.apple.AuthenticationServices.AuthorizationError 1004. Keep {detail} unchanged.
#: src/features/auth/utils/PasskeyErrorMessages.ts
msgid "Your passkey or security key couldn't finish the request. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact support with this error: {detail}"
msgstr "Ključ za dostop ali varnostni ključ ni mogel dokončati zahteve. Poskusi znova, če pa se napaka ponavlja, se obrni na podporo in navedi to napako: {detail}"

#. Recovery kit modal description shown after someone recovers their account with a recovery key.
#: src/features/auth/components/modals/RecoveryKitModal.tsx
msgid "Your password is reset. Your old recovery kit no longer works. Store this new one somewhere safe."
msgstr "Geslo je ponastavljeno. Tvoj stari komplet za obnovitev ne deluje več. Novega shrani na varno mesto."

